    "name": "Twin Jet Racer",
    "steam_appid": 1998220,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Built For Speed</h2>    <br>What do you get when you bolt a pair of jets onto a road cruiser hovership? A freakin\u2019 rocket, that\u2019s what! They\u2019re blazing fast, they can climb the walls and even fly.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/b36ec5b63d6bfd0a234cfb2841610aff.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/b36ec5b63d6bfd0a234cfb2841610aff.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/b36ec5b63d6bfd0a234cfb2841610aff.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defy Gravity </h2>Sure, these ships are fast but they\u2019re so much more than that. Swerve, drift, corkscrew, loop the loop - whatever environment you\u2019re in, it\u2019s just you versus the physics. And when you take off, you don\u2019t come down until you decide it\u2019s time!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cd9762e175dda91911544677cf0420f9.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cd9762e175dda91911544677cf0420f9.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cd9762e175dda91911544677cf0420f9.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master The Controls </h2> Forget what you know about handling cars, bikes, even hoverships. These things are different. Start with the basics: left and right thrust is all you\u2019ll need at first. Then later you can start easing into the pitch and strafe controls to give you that edge. And when you\u2019ve mastered one vehicle, there\u2019s another more powerful beast waiting to be tamed.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cb09803b046473fac7c2b91c34c40ef4.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cb09803b046473fac7c2b91c34c40ef4.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cb09803b046473fac7c2b91c34c40ef4.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete And Win</h2>Compete against friends or against the clock in a series of timed checkpoint challenges in different environments, from tight tracks to open playgrounds. And with community modded race tracks, there are always new challenges to take on.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feature List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 vehicles each with a distinct power and handling profile<br></li><li>12 tracks set in 6 different lush environments<br></li><li>3 race modes: time trial, single race and tournament<br></li><li>Online and local multiplayer<br></li><li>Customise your vehicle<br></li><li>Custom tracks<br></li><li>Adaptive music</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Built For Speed</h2>    <br>What do you get when you bolt a pair of jets onto a road cruiser hovership? A freakin\u2019 rocket, that\u2019s what! They\u2019re blazing fast, they can climb the walls and even fly.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/b36ec5b63d6bfd0a234cfb2841610aff.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/b36ec5b63d6bfd0a234cfb2841610aff.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/b36ec5b63d6bfd0a234cfb2841610aff.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defy Gravity </h2>Sure, these ships are fast but they\u2019re so much more than that. Swerve, drift, corkscrew, loop the loop - whatever environment you\u2019re in, it\u2019s just you versus the physics. And when you take off, you don\u2019t come down until you decide it\u2019s time!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cd9762e175dda91911544677cf0420f9.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cd9762e175dda91911544677cf0420f9.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cd9762e175dda91911544677cf0420f9.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master The Controls </h2> Forget what you know about handling cars, bikes, even hoverships. These things are different. Start with the basics: left and right thrust is all you\u2019ll need at first. Then later you can start easing into the pitch and strafe controls to give you that edge. And when you\u2019ve mastered one vehicle, there\u2019s another more powerful beast waiting to be tamed.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cb09803b046473fac7c2b91c34c40ef4.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cb09803b046473fac7c2b91c34c40ef4.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/cb09803b046473fac7c2b91c34c40ef4.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete And Win</h2>Compete against friends or against the clock in a series of timed checkpoint challenges in different environments, from tight tracks to open playgrounds. And with community modded race tracks, there are always new challenges to take on.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.poster.avif?t=1745833811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.webm?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1998220/extras/d3efb4a588a0557523d61bfd4ec45e23.mp4?t=1745833811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feature List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 vehicles each with a distinct power and handling profile<br></li><li>12 tracks set in 6 different lush environments<br></li><li>3 race modes: time trial, single race and tournament<br></li><li>Online and local multiplayer<br></li><li>Customise your vehicle<br></li><li>Custom tracks<br></li><li>Adaptive music</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Two jets. Two triggers. That\u2019s all you need to swerve, drift, corkscrew, loop or even fly to reach the next checkpoint and top the leaderboard. Master the controls and the physics to progress to the next class of racer and unlock greater challenges. Compete against friends or against the clock.",
